  MODULE 22: SECURITY                                                    [✓] 100%
================================================================================
  [✓] Session-based auth (web)
  [✓] Sanctum token auth (API)
  [✓] Spatie RBAC (roles + permissions)
  [✓] Rate limiting (60/min public, 600/min authenticated)
  [✓] CSRF protection (VerifyCsrfToken middleware)
  [✓] XSS protection (stevebauman/purify)
  [✓] AuditObserver auto-trails on all key models
  [✓] 2FA infrastructure (middleware, model, controller)
  [✓] SetSchoolContext middleware
  [✓] Email verification enforcement (MustVerifyEmail on User model)
  [✓] Password policy enforcement (min 8, mixedCase, numbers, symbols —
      RegisterController + API resetPassword + Password::defaults() globally)
  [✓] Session timeout (SessionTimeout middleware — configurable via settings
      table; config/session.php hardened: secure=true, same_site=strict,
      encrypt=true)
  [✓] Row-level security (ScopeToOwnData middleware + ScopesStudentData trait;
      students/parents scoped in API StudentController + marks routes)
  [✓] File upload validation (ValidateFileUpload middleware — MIME allowlist,
      extension blocklist, 20 MB cap, JSON-aware errors; AntiVirusScanService
      with ClamAV hook; FileManagerController wired to validate.upload)
  [✓] Encrypted sensitive fields (national_id on users — 'encrypted' cast;
      8 PHI fields on medical_records — 'encrypted' casts; migration
      2026_07_21_800000 adds columns and widens to longText)
  [✓] 2FA TOTP real implementation (TotpService — pure-PHP RFC 6238, no SDK
      needed; API AuthController stubs replaced with full TOTP + recovery
      code logic; web TwoFactorController already production-quality)
  [✓] Security headers middleware (SecurityHeaders — CSP with upgrade-insecure-
      requests + object-src none + worker-src; HSTS with preload; CORP/COOP/
      COEP; Permissions-Policy; X-Content-Type-Options; X-Frame-Options;
      fingerprint headers removed)

